page('credits.html','Photography & credits','Photographer attribution and licences for Holiday Host destination imagery.',`${head('Photo credits','Credit where<br>it belongs.','Destination inspiration does not depict a confirmed group or establish a service inclusion.')}<section class="section"><div class="wrap prose"><h2>Pangong Tso, Ladakh</h2><p><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Pangong_tso.jpeg">Pangong tso.jpeg</a> by Aru003, licensed <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/">CC BY 4.0</a>. Resized and recompressed from Wikimedia Commons; displayed crops vary. No endorsement implied.</p><h2>Patnitop, Jammu</h2><p><a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:At_patnitop.jpg">At patnitop.jpg</a> by Amishariya singh, licensed <a href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>. Resized and recompressed; displayed crops vary. Adapted files remain under that licence: <a href="assets/patnitop-1280.jpg">1280px</a>, <a href="assets/patnitop-640.jpg">640px</a>. No endorsement implied.</p>${allPhotoCredits()}<h2>Design</h2><p>Original Holiday Host layout, copy, code, and SVG mark. Wildfloc was reviewed as a feature and market-price reference; its logos, customer stories, statistics, photographs, and wording have not been copied.</p></div></section>`);
